<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Wooofah!!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">September 28. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b><p align="left">What a night! :D Just deserves and update for itself!!
Started out in UP, nice and quiet, nothing up for us but our old friend Tawro
Icequake. Killing him in no time, getting us another bracer and a nice book
stick for Ord :) Grats!<p align="left">With Dain being taken, Velk &amp;
Servitor sleeping, we stopped by in WW to hug our good friends, the guardians of
ToV. 1 lousy 7/6 is what we were rewarded! Bleh! Grats to the winners!<p align="left">Right
after Rak Saphara took yet another dirtnap, Kelorek'Dar was reported up, and in
30 secs, the entire guild was moved to CS rdy to kill him. Down he went at the
blink of an eye! Grats Kulack on the Orb, and rot/guild bank on rest. Pfft. CoCW
Dammit!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/KelorekDarsmall.jpg" width="382" height="299"><p align="left">Raid
was called and everybody went about their own business. Phew, finally over I
thought, but just look what happened within the next 3 hours...<p align="left">Danvi
reported that our litttle friend Doomshade was up. We quickly gathered up again,
and within 30 mins, everyone had reported to UP. However, sadly for him, DS
choosed to poof on us as we were almost ready to get him. Lucky for us,
Zelnithak spawned and thought he could actually harm us! We pulled him, got 2
adds, engaged him, got trained with an additional 3 adds, kept fighting, got him
to 30%, chanters die cause of unmezzable adds, kept on fighting, MT went down
cause of lag, killed Zelth, laughed at him, killed the 7 adds and danced on his
grave. Nite nite Donkey!<p align="left">Grats Nyriaa on book, Aveda on Bracer!
:)<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Zelnithaksmall.jpg" width="466" height="341"><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Guess
what, Rumblecrush was up! :) well, for a few that was. First time the new
Darksphere went head to head with him, and guess who won! :) Darksphere 1 -
Rumblecrush 0! What a rush!! It was getting really really late, and after 10
hours of non stop raiding, we still managed to drop him like a bird!! Awesome
work guys!! That's what I call dedication! Grats Darksphere, and grats to ALL
the Winners! Dlan on your new pink BP, Ferlos on Mask, Tonpon on Earring!&nbsp;<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Rumblecrush.jpg" width="482" height="466"><p align="center">BOOYA!<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Nailed
PoH yesterday also, with a full spawn. Magi P'tasa, you're on my official hate
list! Grrrr! First time you spawn on us and you don't even have the frigging
staff! Inno, you can whine, you add you can agro us, you're still going buh
bye!&nbsp;<br>
Darksphere 2 - Innoruuk 0!<br>
Grats Terakkan on your Earthcaller!! Sorry no pic!! =/<p align="left">2 days,
and this is what we ended up with! Well, missing lootshot from Kelorek.<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Innoruukloot.jpg" width="124" height="201"><img border="0" src="Kills/Rumblecrushloot.jpg" align="top" width="118" height="159"><img border="0" src="Kills/Zelnithakloot.jpg" align="top" width="121" height="141"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/BPofIntegrety.jpg" width="401" height="232"><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Grats
to all the winners!!! Vindicator tomorrow!! Buh bye!


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Epic!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">September 25. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b><p align="left">This week Darksphere completed two of the most time
consuming Epic quests in EQ. We got ourselves the first all Darksphere made
shizznut stick! A huge congratulations to Adreiana on your chanter Epic!!! Most unbelievable
thing is, that when she joined us a few weeks ago, she hadn't even started it
yet :) WTG!!<p align="left">Furthermore, I am so very proud to present,
Darkspheres first Lightsaber wielding Main Tank!! To think that just a few month
ago, this man was wearing thurg armor and blood runed - now he is in full Kael
Armor with Epic!! Ladies and Gentlemen, I give you:<p align="center"><b>Marshall
Vikos&nbsp;<br>
&lt;Darksphere&gt;</b><p align="center"><img border="0" src="VikosEpicsmall.jpg" width="455" height="362"><p align="center">CONGRATULATIONS!<p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="center">Adreiana<p align="center"><img border="0" src="AdreEpic.jpg" width="383" height="489"><p align="center">GRATS!!<p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="left">WTB
Green Dragon Scale, k tnx, kikou - so we can get another set of Lightsabers to
our other MT Bragnar!<p align="center"><a href="Kills/QueenDizok.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/QueenDizoksmall.jpg" width="392" height="267"></a><p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="left">Lodizal
took a dirt nap, again. Grats to all the winners there.<p align="left">90% of
the Basement in Ssra got cleared without a sweat. Actually kinda funny when you
start to nuke at 90% health, and when you're almost done casting, the mob is at
20%... /sigh<p align="left">Plane of Fear - cleared. Everything up, everything
down (well, still can't take CT cause of that damn rotation /sigh).&nbsp;<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left"><b>Quotes
of the week</b><p align="left">Come on people! :) Make some more mistakes! Guild
chat has become far to innocent :D<p align="left">Dlaaaannnn.... Red armor aint
a reason to stay ghey :P<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/134.jpg" width="277" height="25"><p align="left">Crossdresser
jokes never get to old :D<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/135.jpg" width="368" height="16"><p align="left">First,
last and only quote made by me that you will ever see :) Vikos, I love you, but
not like that! :D<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/137.jpg" width="446" height="13"><p align="left">/mourn
Fabbas<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/139.jpg" width="478" height="25"><p align="left">We
need more druids!!! I know Dlan does...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/136.jpg" width="219" height="15"><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Until
next time! Stay good!


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Ok ok! I will update!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">September 20. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b><p align="left">Vikos threatened me, that if I didn't update the page, he
would release some pictures of Dlandridel and Bragnar - together, so here it
is!!!<p align="left">With that terror picture in our minds, lets have a look at
what happened in Darksphere the past week.<p align="left">Well, Lodizal went
down - twice :) Giving us a total of 3 new shields! Grats to all the winners!
Awesome job rushing there guys, we will continue to do so! :D<p align="left">Plane
of Fear... Well, you owed one and you sure have your own fun humor. We went in
with a usual Darksphere break in - pull everything in sight, save less for
later... Gotta love that :D Halfway through the clearing, Cazic himself decided
to show up in person, so we could humiliate him and his plane in front of him!
But damn he and his &quot;minions&quot; are greedy! Fright, Terror, Dread,
Dracho... Up one minute, down the next, with the most crappy loot ever seen by
mankind. Thank you, we could have had 2 more epics that night, but nooooo. /rude
VI! Unfortunately the KGC rotations kept us from giving CT himself a dirt nap
too, but that's life on Karana. Grats to all the winners! Oh! And we got the
Shissar too! Putting Adre like 3 mobs from shizznut speed stick!<p align="left">The
so called guardians of Temple of Veeshan, took another dirt nap - twice in a
night, giving us &quot;only&quot; 7/6 talismans. Grats to all the winners here!<p align="left">Temple
of Veeshan armor farming is getting trivial, but that's not enough reason for us
to stop doing it! From 2 days of farming, we got 1 leather drop (Grats bank), 2
silk drops (Grats bank x2), 20 pieces of Chain armor, 10239 pieces of Plate and
finally!!! a Chain Breastplate!! Come on ToV, how many more rangers have to
suffer before you give us more BPs!?!<p align="left">And as the highlight of the
week, we took a little trip to visit the Chardok Royals. I must say, it was a
rather painful experience for them! Well, thanks to VI pathing and such, it was
a bit painful to us too, but we <u>always</u> get a cleric camped! Due to lack
of time, we didn't have time to wave goodbye to the Queen herself. /sigh - She
will go down next time!<p align="center"><a href="Kills/OverkingBathezid.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/OverkingBathezidsmall.jpg" width="320" height="256"></a><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left"><b>Quotes
of the week!</b><p align="left">Not many - you guys have been slacking! :)<p align="left">Oooh,
we also said goodbye to a very very eye poking annoying wurm, that constantly
annoy all of us giants lovers in WW... /bye Mraaka /kick Mraaka. No loot, but
who cares :P<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/129.jpg" width="131" height="14"><p align="left">Another
one of its kind took a dirt nap *DUCKS*<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/130.jpg" width="125" height="14"><p align="left">So
you will believe her when she says:<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/131.jpg" width="486" height="41"><p align="left">1-1
Tann e :)<p align="left">I love chanters, I really do, but... :D<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/132.jpg" width="404" height="14"><p align="left">/sigh
rogues.<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/133.jpg" width="262" height="132"><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Until
next time!


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Chhaaannnttteeerrsss!!!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">September 13. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">All our thoughts go to the people who
died on September 11. 2001. May your soul rest in peace, and may the world never
see a day like that again! We will not forget!<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">With
this said, lets move on.<p align="left">Well, we went back to PoH, again, in the
hopes of finding some more epic mobs. Still no Magi, sorry Tanne, hope to see
him next time! However one of the minis did drop a ranger epic stone, so grats
Danuvil on your second half of your epic!!!&nbsp;<p align="center"><img border="0" src="DanuEpic.jpg" width="290" height="362"><p align="center">Take
a look at this ranger beauty!!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="RangerEpic.jpg" width="406" height="196"><p align="center">:D<p align="left">2
more epics were completed! Grats Viscero on your new epic poker, and Goldmond on
your new Water sprinkler!!! About time if you would say so yourself :P Grats
man, I know what its like to have been doing your epic quest for over a year :)<p align="left">And
did you all notice?? Darksphere got chanters!!! :D Yep, 4 new of them! KEI, VoG
all of it :P Please give a warm welcome to Adreiana, Trinko, Surdatiny and
Novakaine!<p align="left">Tanne reached the big 6 0, also a big Grats to her! I
see more and more on the way there, keep it up! :)<p align="left">Temple of
Veeshan - you little!!! Damn you and your crappy armor drops! What did you give
us? 10 armor drops in 2 days? Geez! You can do better! /rude<p align="left">We
got a new section on the page, a Guestbook. So all you friends out there who
read our pages but are mad at us for locking our forums, please feel free to
leave us a message! :)<p align="left">Lord Bob took a dirt nap to 2 of our elite
groups, but I'm still missing those screenshots /tap Katenia :) Grats to all the
winners there!<p align="left"><b>Quotes of the week!</b><p align="left">Gruz has
teamed up with the french dudes over at Armonia, look for yeself, this is all
the proof I need...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/119.jpg" width="245" height="40"><p align="left">Braggy
- wont be long till I have to make a section for you alone...<br>
Tales of the Gay O War<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/120.jpg" width="370" height="14"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/121.jpg" width="293" height="15"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/122.jpg" width="526" height="27"><p align="left">Yea
I know Tzarx aint one of our, but if you see him, tell him I said come join
Darksphere! :P<p align="left">We all make mistakes - well, some worse than
others, we can't all be potters now can we? :D<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/123.jpg" width="532" height="27"><p align="left">And
what do you know? The man comes out of the closet!!<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/124.jpg" width="283" height="14"><p align="left">Now
we just need to get Dlan to follow his example...<p align="left"><b>From the
Cadence Mansion!</b><p align="left">I'm getting worried... you? /mourn Senya<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/125.jpg" width="542" height="28"><p align="left">Goldy...
I know getting epic gets you high, but easy now! :)<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/126.jpg" width="329" height="16"><p align="left">Tann
e... She claims that she was close to 60, but we all know better...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/127.jpg" width="226" height="14"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/128.jpg" width="222" height="14"><p align="left">Dlan
bro, I helped you get Vikos, so I'm guessing I have to help him get to you...<p align="center"><img border="0" src="DlandGhey.jpg" width="324" height="422"><p align="center">And
what do you know!!! 2 GHEYS IN ONE PIC! :D<p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="left">Until
next time guys!<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Wuoshi who? Inny? DEAD DEAD DEAD!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">September 7. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b><p align="left">Send Darksphere on vacation and they return to kill lil
Wuoshi and a poor little God Wuoshi spawned on a lil druid of ours, and an hour
later he took the longest dirt nap ever! We moved fast and with the same eager
we always show to succeed! He gave us a lil fight, but we always know who ends
up being the winner :P<p align="left">Bye bye Wuoshi, welcome Gorenaire! We're
coming for your scaly arse!<p align="center"><a href="Kills/Wuoshi.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/WuoshiSmall.jpg" width="481" height="320"></a><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/WuoshiLoot.jpg" width="121" height="196"><p align="center">Grats
TR on the Blades, Goldmond, Myself and some alt on the scales!<p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="left">Innoruuk?
You're a joke! Your plane is to easy and a ranger could MT you!. Hell, our CH
team didn't even break a sweat and never got below 75% mana... /sigh. Awesome
work from every class here! Mages for keeping the clerics supplied with Mod
Rods, Necros for feeding them mana, and the best CH rotation ever! Slow
landed easier on you than on a lil CT mob... It took us 5 mins to humiliate this
so called Prince of Hate... Poor inny, we can't have it all can we now? :P Well,
Darksphere can, we got what we came for! Grats Zacknaar on your second and final
half of your Epic!!! Grats Midgar on your new mask and Ferlos on the gnome
ring!! Better luck next time Inny! ;)<p align="center"><a href="Kills/Innoruuk.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/InnoruukSmall.jpg" width="500" height="261"></a><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/InnyLoot.jpg" width="119" height="201"><p align="center">Grats
Midgar on Mask, Me on belt, Ferlos on Ring, Rot on Shoulders and lil Zack on
Epic Stone!!<p align="left">The day before this, we took a stop by Iceclad, to
help out fave lil Necro out, with a lil no good quest. After fighting waves and
waves of teeny giants (I KNOW you loved to keel em!!), mem blurring and
swimming, the quest ended at some no good gnome camp, and some lousy Avatar of
Below spawned and gave this n00b loot to Senya.<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/8thShawl.jpg" width="399" height="189"><p align="center">GRATS
SENYA!! WOOT!<p align="left">Fire and Ice took a dirt nap before that also...
again. Grats Bacck on your new Flaming Dirk, Pudgy on Bracer of sense and Vikos
on Shadow Heart!<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left"><b>QUOTES!!</b><p align="left">I
think this perfectly describes last night...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/112.jpg" width="243" height="15"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/113.jpg" width="170" height="15"><p align="left">Hell
yea! PROUD!<p align="left">But Gruz... wrong path bro, wrong path<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/114.jpg" width="558" height="27"><p align="left">THIS
is why we won tonight! (You do an awesome job Vikos! :)<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/115.jpg" width="181" height="14"><p align="left">We
all know where rogues spend the most of their times, so I guess its no wonder
why they develop a fetish...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/116.jpg" width="178" height="14"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/117.jpg" width="217" height="14"><p align="left"><b>Lil
one from the Cadence Mansion</b><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/118.jpg" width="522" height="28"><p align="left">/comfort
Senya. Dlan, you're married! :P<p align="left">THIS scared the crap out of me!!!
NOOOOOO<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/Bragnude.jpg" width="380" height="452"><p align="left">And
Vikos... Where the hell were you during the vacation? Think Dlan tracked you
down!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="MoviePoster.jpg" width="343" height="500"><p align="center">And
pics from Vikos' new upcoming movie!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Vikos.jpg" width="459" height="324"><p align="center">/mourn
Vikos<p align="center">&nbsp;<p align="left">Thank ya all!! You're THE BEST!!
DARKSPHERE FOREVER!


    

     

